msgctxt "40\t210"
msgid ""
"I suppose it was my fault for allowing\\nKanda to rise so far above his "
"station."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220\t402"
msgid ""
"You have my deepest apologies.\\nCan we consider this Nishikiyama Family "
"incident resolved?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "575\t746"
msgid ""
"I plan to assemble the Tojo Clan families\\nwithout delay and attempt to "
"restore order."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "743\t875"
msgid "As for Hamazaki, my Hakuho men are searching for him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "887\t1028"
msgid "Though... I suspect he won't turn up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1046\t1177"
msgid "Do you have some idea\\nwhere he might have gone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1178\t1296"
msgid "I do. I imagine he's no longer in the country."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1311\t1365"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "Cosa intendi?"

msgctxt "1370\t1503"
msgid "The head of the Japanese Snake Flower branch,\\nLau Ka Long, is dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1514\t1613"
msgid "Snake Flower headquarters\\nwould never accept such failure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1629\t1832"
msgid ""
"And given Hamazaki was Lau's partner,\\nthey've surely kidnapped him in "
"retaliation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1847\t2024"
msgid ""
"The rest of his family was apparently\\nfound floating in the Yokohama Bay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2090\t2147"
msgid "That's the Snake Flower, all right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2148\t2360"
msgid ""
"In any case, without us even having to\\nlift a finger... the Hamazaki "
"Family is gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2366\t2587"
msgid ""
"I plan to reach out to Snake Flower headquarters\\nto hopefully prevent any "
"further bloodshed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2595\t2655"
msgid "That so?"
msgstr "Ah sì?"

msgctxt "2663\t2873"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san... The Tojo Clan is on a knife's edge.\\nWe need you now more than"
" ever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2877\t2978"
msgid "I suggest you take care of yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3073\t3133"
msgid "Farewell."
msgstr "Addio."

msgctxt "3258\t3318"
msgid "Mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3319\t3409"
msgid "Who told you to handle things like this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3480\t3572"
msgid "I'm not sure I follow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3579\t3766"
msgid ""
"Then let me restate. Would Daigo have\\ndone the same thing in your shoes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3811\t3910"
msgid "I doubt it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3911\t3962"
msgid "Then why are you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3963\t4083"
msgid "Well, Daigo is no longer\\nthe one giving orders."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4100\t4263"
msgid "This decision was mine, and mine alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4279\t4378"
msgid "By the way, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4391\t4552"
msgid "Some of the blame for all of this...\\nrests on your very shoulders."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4570\t4762"
msgid "Daigo-san told me everything.\\nAbout your orphanage in Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4773\t4834"
msgid "You're a coward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4886\t4970"
msgid "No regard for the position you hold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4971\t5144"
msgid ""
"You may think you're turning over a new leaf.\\nBut it's all meaningless."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5155\t5198"
msgid "Mere hypocrisy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5199\t5259"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr "Cosa!?"

msgctxt "5267\t5389"
msgid "I intend on moving forward\\nin the way I see most fit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5390\t5543"
msgid ""
"Methods aside... I do see myself as\\nthe successor to Daigo-san's legacy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5549\t5640"
msgid "Mine, you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5641\t5838"
msgid ""
"In other words, every last thing I do\\nis done with the aim of aiding the "
"Tojo Clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5854\t5943"
msgid "A motive I'm sure Daigo-san would approve of."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5954\t6063"
msgid "Anyone that stands in my way will be eliminated."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6108\t6234"
msgid "Even if that person...\\nis one of our own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6280\t6348"
msgid "I'll never understand it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6362\t6483"
msgid "What could Daigo-san see in a man like you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6554\t6679"
msgid "Mine. You've lost your way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6717\t6776"
msgid "Excuse me?"
msgstr "Mi scusi?"

msgctxt "6777\t6899"
msgid "And someday...\\nI'll prove it to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6927\t7058"
msgid "I don't expect you will.\\nI have nothing to learn from you."
msgstr ""
